WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
My hands, which have been recovering from illness for many years, have become rusty.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,560
This sleeve is wrong no matter what

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:08,600
You are so skillful and meticulous, why not teach me?

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:13,000
This fragrance

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,770
My uncle is not in the house at all these days

6
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:18,730
How could my aunt be thinking about other men?

7
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:26,320
It's cold today, but you still feel good

8
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:28,720
Is there any hint that I still feel dizzy after taking medicine?

9
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:31,840
I have been bothering my aunt for a long time and am planning to go back.

10
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:34,440
Why are you leaving in a hurry? You haven't eaten yet, right?

11
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:37,000
Since we are here, let’s have a meal together

12
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:40,460
Husband, I am really very tired.

13
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:42,520
I drank the decoction early in the morning

14
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:44,240
No appetite today

15
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:46,400
I'm afraid I won't be able to have dinner with my husband.
